  "title": "Faworki (Polish Chrusciki)",
  "description": "Faworki are deep-fried crispy pastry twists dusted with confectioners' sugar, a sweet Polish treat traditionally served in Carnival season.",
  "authors": [
    "jacekf"
  ],
